<h3>About Introduction to Supply Chain Management</h3>

<p>This chapter will be a brief introduction to supply chain mangment. It will discuss what the supply chain is as well as the many various components that go into it. It will introduce you many different areas involved in the supply chain from procument, to operations to distribution. We will also discuss inventory as well and some predictive models for it. This chapter also includes many important functioning areas of a business that lead to a smooth and successful supply chain.</p>

